45
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:54,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"Go, Goku! Commence Assault"</font>

46
00:02:00,980 --> 00:02:05,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander. Colonel Violet has
