47
00:02:07,580 --> 00:02:12,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have just returned. I apologize
for taking so long to find it.</font>

48
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good work!</font>

49
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:17,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Once Tao Pai Pai returns
I will have six of them!</font>

50
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:20,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The accuracy of the enemy's
radar you lent me was incredible.</font>

51
00:02:20,730 --> 00:02:23,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">With it, I was able to
locate the ball very easily.</font>

52
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:27,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Now give the
radar to General Kappa</font>

53
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:30,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and tell him to find the
last Dragon Ball immediately!</font>

54
00:02:30,910 --> 00:02:32,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir!</font>

55
00:02:32,330 --> 00:02:36,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander! The four Dragon
Balls have passed into Area B!</font>

56
00:02:36,510 --> 00:02:40,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Estimated time of
arrival is 15 minutes!</font>

57
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:42,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That lousy Tao Pai Pai,
always keeping me waiting!</font>

58
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the?</font>

59
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:08,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You sure are weird...</font>

60
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:11,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There he is! Son-<i>kun</i>!</font>

61
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:14,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, it is!</font>

62
00:03:14,390 --> 00:03:16,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's alive!</font>

63
00:03:16,930 --> 00:03:18,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is he on his way back here?</font>

64
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:20,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll check!</font>

65
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:30,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No! It looks like he's heading toward
these two Dragon Balls over here!</font>

66
00:03:30,210 --> 00:03:34,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He certainly is a lost cause.
He hasn't come back at all.</font>

67
00:03:34,950 --> 00:03:36,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That location...</font>

68
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:39,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is really something!</font>

69
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:42,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">To think you could make something
like this out of ordinary parts...</font>

70
00:03:42,790 --> 00:03:45,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you're not just a
big-breasted girl after all...</font>

71
00:03:45,930 --> 00:03:50,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You never know when to
shut your mouth, do you?!</font>

72
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:56,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You don't think he's on his way
to Red Ribbon HQ, do you?</font>

73
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:57,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?!</font>

74
00:03:57,770 --> 00:04:01,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course not! Not even
Goku is that reckless...</font>

75
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll check!</font>

76
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:05,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Check how?</font>

77
00:04:05,610 --> 00:04:11,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By sending the surveillance plane
towards those other Dragon Balls!</font>

78
00:04:11,350 --> 00:04:15,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What do you want?
Why are you following me?</font>

79
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:22,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He left...!</font>

80
00:04:22,460 --> 00:04:25,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wow, he's even faster than <i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

81
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:28,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander!</font>

82
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:32,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">An unidentified flying object is
approaching from R2 at tremendous speed!</font>

83
00:04:32,730 --> 00:04:34,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you sure it isn't Tao Pai Pai?</font>

84
00:04:34,670 --> 00:04:38,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, it isn't! It appears
to be a surveillance craft!</font>

85
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:41,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Activate Defense System #1! Destroy it!</font>

86
00:04:41,510 --> 00:04:42,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir!</font>

87
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:01,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We should be getting close now!</font>

88
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:03,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll switch to a different view!</font>

89
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:08,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait! Radar signals detected?!</font>

90
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:15,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh no!</font>

91
00:05:51,150 --> 00:05:52,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It is!</font>

92
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:54,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's Red Ribbon's headquarters.</font>

93
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:57,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is he planning on raiding it?!</font>

94
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It got shot down!</font>

95
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excellent!</font>

96
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:16,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tao Pai Pai will be
entering the defense area!</font>

97
00:06:16,410 --> 00:06:19,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shut down all defense systems!</font>

98
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:22,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now what do we do?! Not even
Son-<i>kun</i> could survive going there!</font>

99
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You saw what just happened!</font>

100
00:06:24,350 --> 00:06:26,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's outta his mind!</font>

101
00:06:26,010 --> 00:06:31,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, I suppose we have no
other choice but to go help him...</font>

102
00:06:31,350 --> 00:06:33,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-How are you going to get there?</font>

103
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:38,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, that's right! We've run
out of modes of transportation.</font>

104
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:41,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ugh! If only we could contact Yamucha!</font>

105
00:06:41,060 --> 00:06:43,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why don't you call him, then?</font>

106
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:46,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You know there aren't any phones here!</font>

107
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:50,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then why don't you make one, Bulma-<i>san</i>?</font>

108
00:06:50,770 --> 00:06:55,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Seeing as how you built that amazing
device, a phone should be a cinch...</font>

109
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:58,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh! You're right...</font>

110
00:06:58,550 --> 00:06:59,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're so smart!</font>

111
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:11,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's hard to tell if she's
a genius or an idiot...</font>

112
00:07:12,230 --> 00:07:13,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Finished!</font>

113
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Yoo-hoo!</i></font>

114
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:24,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dad! It's me, Bulma! Is Yamucha there?!</font>

115
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:26,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Oh, Bulma. It's good to hear from you.</i></font>

116
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:30,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Perfect timing! I just came up</i>
<i>with a great pun! Here, listen to it!</i></font>

117
00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:34,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's no time, just
hurry and put Yamucha on!</font>

118
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:37,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But it was a really good pun, though...</font>

119
00:07:37,350 --> 00:07:38,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where did you go?!</font>

120
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:44,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They told me you went with Goku
to find the Dragon Balls, but...</font>

121
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:47,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! Goku's going to
fight the Red Ribbon Army?!</font>

122
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:49,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right! Right!</font>

123
00:07:49,810 --> 00:07:51,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I don't like the sound of this.</i></font>

124
00:07:51,670 --> 00:07:53,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I bet she wants us to go there...</i></font>

125
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:56,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! We'll go right away!</font>

126
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:57,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pu-erh! Oolong!</font>

127
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:02,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're going to help Goku! We're
storming the Red Ribbon Army!</font>

128
00:08:04,490 --> 00:08:07,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-The Red Ribbon Army?!</font>

129
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're up against a formidable opponent!</font>

130
00:08:08,990 --> 00:08:13,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I don't mind. I was starting to get
sick of comfortable city life anyway!</font>

131
00:08:16,950 --> 00:08:21,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">3 minutes, 40 seconds
until Tao Pai Pai arrives!</font>

132
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:23,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is it.</font>

133
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:57,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There it is! That's it!</font>

134
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:00,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here comes Tao Pai Pai...</font>

135
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:13,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Hurry and get in!
- Shut up, don't rush me!</font>

136
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:23,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Time to kick butt!</font>

137
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:26,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How come I have to go?! I'm weak!</font>

138
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:30,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Same here! I don't feel like dyin' yet!</font>

139
00:10:30,050 --> 00:10:32,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sure you'll all be
useful in your own ways.</font>

140
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:35,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Plus you all owe Goku for saving
you at one time or another!</font>

141
00:10:35,890 --> 00:10:37,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Um...</font>

142
00:10:37,890 --> 00:10:42,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you really think I can be of use?</font>

143
00:10:42,230 --> 00:10:43,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sure ya can.</font>

144
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:47,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Emergency food in case
somethin' bad happens.</font>

145
00:10:47,330 --> 00:10:49,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You can't be serious!</font>

146
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:51,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's with this chick?!</font>

147
00:10:51,070 --> 00:10:51,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah!</font>

148
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Muten Roshi-<i>sama</i>!</font>

149
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?</font>

150
00:10:54,070 --> 00:10:56,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What happened to that Kuririn fellow?</font>

151
00:10:56,670 --> 00:11:00,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh. He's swimming in the ocean
on his way to go shopping.</font>

152
00:11:00,710 --> 00:11:04,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">After all, we did run out of vehicles.</font>

153
00:11:04,420 --> 00:11:09,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He'll be really useful in battle!
We have to get him to help us!</font>

154
00:11:09,590 --> 00:11:12,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He should be swimming
in that area down there.</font>

155
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:13,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

156
00:11:20,310 --> 00:11:22,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Unit 84! Unit 84!</i></font>

157
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:26,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Check that it's our Mr. Tao Pai Pai</i>
<i>and then lead him back to HQ!</i></font>

158
00:11:26,250 --> 00:11:27,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Roger that!</font>

159
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:42,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What did you say?!</font>

160
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:46,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did Goku really storm
the Red Ribbon Army?</font>

161
00:11:46,730 --> 00:11:47,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's true.</font>

162
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:50,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's he thinking?!</font>

163
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:52,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He isn't thinking.</font>

164
00:11:52,870 --> 00:11:55,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You could say that again.</font>

165
00:11:55,740 --> 00:11:57,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't wait to do this thing!</font>

166
00:11:57,710 --> 00:12:00,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's at times like this that
it's good having you along!</font>

167
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:03,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just don't sneeze at the
wrong time or anything!</font>

168
00:12:04,380 --> 00:12:07,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Bulma. Is this heading alright?</font>

169
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:12,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Keep flying straight!</font>

170
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:14,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How long will it take us to get there?</font>

171
00:12:14,290 --> 00:12:17,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hmm... Around 40 minutes, I suppose.</font>

172
00:12:25,020 --> 00:12:26,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here he comes!</font>

173
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:27,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excellent!</font>

174
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:30,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Unit 84! Unit 84!</i></font>

175
00:12:30,860 --> 00:12:33,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Here he comes! It's Tao Pai Pai!</i></font>

176
00:12:33,530 --> 00:12:34,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Copy, that!</font>

177
00:12:45,210 --> 00:12:48,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No! It isn't Tao Pai Pai!</font>

178
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Extend, <i>Nyoibou</i>!</font>

179
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:23,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unit 84! Come in! Unit 84! Unit 84!</font>

180
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:24,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What happened?!</font>

181
00:13:24,850 --> 00:13:26,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It appears he was shot down!</font>

182
00:13:26,850 --> 00:13:29,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! How can that be?!</font>

183
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:32,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Switch the monitor view!</font>

184
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Commander!
- What is it?!</font>

185
00:13:33,860 --> 00:13:35,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">L-Look!</font>

186
00:13:36,860 --> 00:13:40,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What's that brat doing here?!</font>

187
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:45,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did he take out Tao Pai Pai?!</font>

188
00:13:45,540 --> 00:13:49,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Activate the defense system
and deploy the combat squadron!</font>

189
00:13:49,710 --> 00:13:50,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">On the double!</font>

190
00:13:50,940 --> 00:13:52,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir!</font>

191
00:13:57,620 --> 00:13:59,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here he comes!</font>

192
00:14:04,830 --> 00:14:06,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-He's fast!</font>

193
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:09,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Time to break in!</font>

194
00:14:09,570 --> 00:14:13,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why that little!
Everyone here is incompetent!</font>

195
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:16,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Listen up! Don't let him take one step in!</font>

196
00:14:16,470 --> 00:14:20,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's already inside!
The terrace in Sector 12!</font>

197
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:40,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Over there!</font>

198
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:56,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kame...</i></font>

199
00:14:56,770 --> 00:14:58,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>...</font>

200
00:14:59,970 --> 00:15:02,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

201
00:15:02,140 --> 00:15:04,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>!</font>

202
00:15:07,150 --> 00:15:08,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What was that?!</font>

203
00:15:11,850 --> 00:15:13,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Over here! He's on the ground!</font>

204
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:28,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's heading straight for Building 8!</font>

205
00:15:28,170 --> 00:15:30,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So he is after the Dragon Balls!</font>

206
00:15:30,810 --> 00:15:34,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander! You should evacuate
underground for safety's sake!</font>

207
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:40,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be stupid! Why should I have
to evacuate because of just one boy?!</font>

208
00:15:40,410 --> 00:15:44,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-But he was strong enough to
defeat the infamous Tao Pai Pai!</font>

209
00:15:44,150 --> 00:15:47,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Red Ribbon Army is invincible!</font>

210
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:57,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Dragon Balls are up there!</font>

211
00:16:05,110 --> 00:16:07,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ouch! I'll get you for that!</font>

212
00:16:07,510 --> 00:16:11,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What is that kid?!</font>

213
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:12,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's now inside Building 8!</font>

214
00:16:12,930 --> 00:16:15,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We've already lost about half
of the soldiers in the area!</font>

215
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:17,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?!</font>

216
00:16:17,070 --> 00:16:21,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And you call yourselves members of Red
Ribbon, the world's most powerful army?!</font>

217
00:16:21,770 --> 00:16:24,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hurry! We're going to Building 8!</font>

218
00:16:24,340 --> 00:16:25,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir!</font>

219
00:16:46,770 --> 00:16:52,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I absolutely will not let him have
the Dragon Balls! I refuse to!</font>

220
00:16:52,910 --> 00:16:56,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But the situation isn't
looking very good at all.</font>

221
00:16:56,550 --> 00:17:01,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That Son Goku kid is far stronger
than we could have possibly imagined!</font>

222
00:17:01,180 --> 00:17:06,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's more, he's already defeated
all of our strongest members</font>

223
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:09,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">while they were out
looking for the balls...</font>

224
00:17:32,790 --> 00:17:34,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They're higher up?</font>

225
00:17:34,300 --> 00:17:36,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? There aren't any stairs...</font>

226
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:51,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I refuse to let the Red Ribbon
Army be defeated by this kid</font>

227
00:17:51,510 --> 00:17:55,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">who doesn't even know
how to use an elevator!</font>

228
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:57,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Runt!</font>

229
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say yer prayers!</font>

230
00:18:23,970 --> 00:18:25,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Got 'im!</font>

231
00:18:25,330 --> 00:18:27,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How do you like them apples?!</font>

232
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:30,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You almost hit me!</font>

233
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:42,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's a monster!</font>

234
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:44,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Run for your lives!</font>

235
00:18:46,770 --> 00:18:48,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Could they be any more pathetic?!</font>

236
00:18:48,470 --> 00:18:51,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And they call themselves
soldiers of the Red Ribbon Army?!</font>

237
00:18:51,140 --> 00:18:52,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander!</font>

238
00:18:52,110 --> 00:18:55,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All the remaining soldiers
appear to be deserting!</font>

239
00:18:55,490 --> 00:18:56,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

240
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:05,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unbelievable!
All because of one little brat!</font>

241
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:10,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would seem we were too slow
in realizing that this Son Goku boy</font>

242
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:13,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">is far stronger than we
could have imagined.</font>

243
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander! We should retreat, too!</font>

244
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:20,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you saying?!</font>

245
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:25,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you think I can just turn tail
and run because of one stupid kid?!</font>

246
00:19:25,220 --> 00:19:27,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then you intend to fight him?</font>

247
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:30,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>You're</i> going to fight him!</font>

248
00:19:30,090 --> 00:19:31,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh?</font>

249
00:19:32,590 --> 00:19:35,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll be setting up our next strategy!</font>

250
00:19:35,690 --> 00:19:41,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You protect me and somehow get
those four Dragon Balls he has!</font>

251
00:19:41,730 --> 00:19:43,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But...</font>

252
00:19:43,330 --> 00:19:45,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No buts!</font>

253
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:51,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Trust me! Can't you take orders
from your own commander?!</font>

254
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:53,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">V-Very well...</font>

255
00:19:56,650 --> 00:19:58,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Listen! I'll be upstairs!</font>

256
00:19:58,950 --> 00:20:03,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do whatever it takes to defeat that brat!</font>

257
00:20:20,670 --> 00:20:22,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you're here.</font>

258
00:20:22,770 --> 00:20:24,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you the boss?!</font>

259
00:20:24,710 --> 00:20:26,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I am not the commander!</font>

260
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:28,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where's the boss?!</font>

261
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:31,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Quiet! You'll be fighting me!</font>

262
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:34,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't think you should,
Mister! You'll get hurt!</font>

263
00:20:34,050 --> 00:20:35,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You seem to be full of confidence,</font>

264
00:20:35,850 --> 00:20:39,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but I won't wind up like
everyone else so far!</font>

265
00:20:50,070 --> 00:20:54,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He isn't hitting him at all!
That undependable loser!</font>

266
00:20:59,540 --> 00:21:04,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought you'd be strong since you
talked big, but that's all you got?!</font>

267
00:21:04,580 --> 00:21:05,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

268
00:21:05,940 --> 00:21:08,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, now it's my turn!</font>

269
00:21:17,250 --> 00:21:23,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Brat! This is the end!</font>

270
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:05,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it! I finally put an end to that runt!</font>

271
00:22:33,930 --> 00:22:39,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn you, Commander Red!
You tried to kill me too!</font>

272
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:54,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Once I pull the boy's corpse out
and take his four Dragon Balls,</font>

273
00:22:54,520 --> 00:22:56,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">there'll be only one left!</font>

274
00:22:57,830 --> 00:23:03,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just one more and my lifelong
dream will come true...</font>

275
00:23:03,030 --> 00:23:08,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Finally... Finally...</font>

276
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:11,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...l'll be able to increase my height!</font>

277
00:23:18,350 --> 00:23:21,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander!</font>

278
00:23:21,020 --> 00:23:23,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you mean by that?!</font>

279
00:23:23,020 --> 00:23:25,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Black! How did you?!</font>

280
00:23:25,750 --> 00:23:27,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander!</font>

281
00:23:27,020 --> 00:23:31,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The reason we sacrificed scores of men
while collecting the Dragon Balls</font>

282
00:23:31,730 --> 00:23:35,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">was so you could become taller?!</font>

283
00:23:35,030 --> 00:23:37,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right! Something wrong with that?!</font>

284
00:23:37,930 --> 00:23:41,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You mean it wasn't so we could
rule over the entire world?!</font>

285
00:23:41,700 --> 00:23:45,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I could do that given enough time!</font>

286
00:23:45,910 --> 00:23:50,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But the ruler has to look
impressive first and foremost!</font>

287
00:23:50,110 --> 00:23:53,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll never be popular with the
girls if I stay short and puny!</font>

288
00:23:53,310 --> 00:23:55,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did all this just for that?!</font>

289
00:23:55,920 --> 00:24:02,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Quiet! A huge guy like you'd never
understand how it feels being so short!</font>

290
00:24:02,890 --> 00:24:05,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ever since I was a schoolboy,
people have constantly teased me</font>

291
00:24:05,330 --> 00:24:08,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and called me names
like "Little Baby Red"!</font>

292
00:24:08,330 --> 00:24:12,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've even been told that I look
like a pint-sized middle-aged man!</font>

293
00:24:12,330 --> 00:24:17,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what's wrong with collecting the
Dragon Balls to make myself taller?!</font>

294
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:19,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm the commander,
so the choice is up to me!</font>

295
00:24:19,910 --> 00:24:25,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're insane! You even tried
to kill me for that lame wish!</font>

296
00:24:25,110 --> 00:24:29,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Silence! How dare you talk to me
that way?! I'm the commander!</font>

297
00:24:29,880 --> 00:24:32,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As my underling, you have
no place to complain,</font>

298
00:24:32,850 --> 00:24:35,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">no matter how I treat you!</font>

299
00:24:35,620 --> 00:24:39,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And besides, I can never
depend on you for...</font>

300
00:24:59,050 --> 00:25:01,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're unqualified to be commander!</font>

301
00:25:01,820 --> 00:25:06,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I</i> will become commander and
rebuild the Red Ribbon Army!</font>

302
00:25:08,160 --> 00:25:11,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I, Black-<i>sama</i>, will be this world's ruler!</font>

303
00:25:28,970 --> 00:25:31,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

304
00:25:28,970 --> 00:25:31,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

305
00:25:31,870 --> 00:25:34,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

306
00:25:31,870 --> 00:25:34,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

307
00:25:34,470 --> 00:25:41,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

308
00:25:34,470 --> 00:25:41,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

309
00:25:41,010 --> 00:25:44,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

310
00:25:41,010 --> 00:25:44,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

311
00:25:44,020 --> 00:25:46,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

312
00:25:44,020 --> 00:25:46,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

313
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:52,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

314
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:52,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

315
00:25:52,530 --> 00:25:58,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

316
00:25:52,530 --> 00:25:58,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

317
00:25:58,530 --> 00:26:04,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

318
00:25:58,530 --> 00:26:04,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

319
00:26:04,700 --> 00:26:15,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

320
00:26:04,700 --> 00:26:15,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

321
00:26:15,850 --> 00:26:23,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

322
00:26:15,850 --> 00:26:23,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

323
00:26:23,420 --> 00:26:27,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

324
00:26:23,420 --> 00:26:27,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

325
00:26:27,890 --> 00:26:35,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

326
00:26:27,890 --> 00:26:35,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

327
00:26:35,300 --> 00:26:43,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

328
00:26:35,300 --> 00:26:43,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

